      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BOONA ROAD (2) was a course and distance placegetter (20.47) last time also from the same draw, finishing a half a length second in a Maiden. Safe beginner and drawn well close to the inside. Tough to beat on best. NO WRINKLES (1) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fourth (20.35) last time in a Maiden at Gunnedah. Comes out of a hot form race last start. Expected to run well. ZIPPING TRAY (8) stalked the pace from a low draw last start and fought on well to finish 3.5 lengths away in second (30.17) at Wentworth Park in a Maiden over 520m. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Hard to beat again. EGOMANIAC (4) should be thereabouts after filling a top-three at this track and distance most recently.",
